Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Rate Limiting Not Working
Symptoms: All requests return HTTP 200, no rate limiting observed

Solutions:

Check EnvoyFilter configuration:
oc get envoyfilter -n istio-system
oc describe envoyfilter filter-ratelimit -n istio-system
Verify rate limiting service is running:
oc get pods -n istio-system | grep ratelimit
oc logs deployment/ratelimit -n istio-system
Check sidecar injection:
oc get pods -n rate-limiting-lab -o jsonpath='{.items[*].spec.containers[*].name}'
Issue 2: Quota Not Enforcing
Symptoms: Resource usage exceeds defined quotas

Solutions:

Verify quota is applied:
oc get quota -n rate-limiting-lab
oc describe quota rate-limiting-quota -n rate-limiting-lab
Check limit ranges:
oc get limitrange -n rate-limiting-lab
oc describe limitrange rate-limiting-limits -n rate-limiting-lab
Issue 3: Network Connectivity Issues
Symptoms: Requests fail with connection errors

Solutions:

Check network policies:
oc get networkpolicy -n rate-limiting-lab
oc describe networkpolicy backend-service-policy -n rate-limiting-lab
Verify service mesh injection:
oc get namespace rate-limiting-lab --show-labels
